# Base origin of the TxGuard API. Vite exposes only variables prefixed with VITE_.
#
# Local development: leave UNSET. Requests stay relative and Vite's dev proxy
# (vite.config.ts) forwards /api and /hubs to localhost:5080.
#
# Production (Vercel): set to the deployed API origin — no trailing slash, no path.
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://txguard.duckdns.org
VITE_API_BASE=
